    "description": "Ten aggregate coin-day panels of simulated last-in-queue touch-quoter entry markout on three crypto perpetual venues, two centralized and one an on-chain central limit order book, with a trade-sign counterfactual panel covering all three venues against their true aggressor flags and a survivorship panel of delisted perpetuals measured on the same rule.",
